{"Title":"An Act promoting equitable distribution of Chapter 90 funds ","BillNumber":"H3409","DocketNumber":"HD290","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T16:40:09.273"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T16:40:09.2733333"},{"Id":"JCD1","Name":"James C. Arena-DeRosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCD1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-23T10:16:04.1433333"},{"Id":"BMA1","Name":"Brian M. Ashe","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BMA1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T19:35:00.6166667"},{"Id":"J_B1","Name":"John Barrett, III","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/J_B1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:10:57.7633333"},{"Id":"CAD1","Name":"Carol A. Doherty","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T16:03:11.4166667"},{"Id":"RME1","Name":"Rodney M. Elliott","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RME1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:03:31.2433333"},{"Id":"TFB1","Name":"Tricia Farley-Bouvier","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TFB1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-08T14:29:57.8433333"},{"Id":"JDM1","Name":"Joseph D. McKenna","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JDM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T12:20:33.7766667"},{"Id":"KWP1","Name":"Kelly W. Pease","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KWP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-25T14:39:45.0433333"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T14:09:50.4233333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3409/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Pignatelli of Lenox, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3409) of Smitty Pignatelli and others relative to expenditures for maintaining, repairing, improving, and constructing municipal ways and bridges and other eligible municipal projects.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 4 of chapter 6C of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2016 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after subsection (b) the following subsection:- \r\n\t        (b½) All expenditures for maintaining, repairing, improving, and constructing municipal ways and bridges, and other eligible municipal projects, made by the department in accordance with subsection (b), shall be allocated by the commissioner based upon the following formula: \r\n\tPopulation………………………………………15.333% \r\n\tRoad Mileage…………………………………....69.334% \r\n\tEmployment……………………………………..15.333%. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}